{"v":15,"id":"e19","kid":"emma","title":"The Science Fair Volcano","zh":"科学展上的\"火山\"","level":"A2+","genre":"校园故事","src":"original","sum":"索菲亚为科学展做了一座会\"喷发\"的火山，前一晚却怎么也不喷。弟弟发现妈妈买错了：是泡打粉不是小苏打。她把失败变成一个真正的实验，赢得了\"最佳科学思维奖\"。","words":306,"paras":[{"t":"For weeks, Sofia had planned to make the best project at the school science fair. She wanted to build a volcano that would really erupt. Every evening after homework, she worked on it in the garage with her little brother, Leo, who was always asking questions.","w":[[0,3,"for",19],[4,9,"weeks",19],[11,16,"Sofia",-1],[17,20,"had",-1],[21,28,"planned",-1],[29,31,"to",-1],[32,36,"make",-1],[37,40,"the",-1],[41,45,"best",-1],[46,53,"project",-1],[54,56,"at",-1],[57,60,"the",-1],[61,67,"school",-1],[68,75,"science",0],[76,80,"fair",0],[82,85,"she",-1],[86,92,"wanted",-1],[93,95,"to",-1],[96,101,"build",-1],[102,103,"a",-1],[104,111,"volcano",-1],[112,116,"that",-1],[117,122,"would",-1],[123,129,"really",-1],[130,135,"erupt",-1],[137,142,"every",-1],[143,150,"evening",-1],[151,156,"after",-1],[157,165,"homework",-1],[167,170,"she",-1],[171,177,"worked",1],[178,180,"on",1],[181,183,"it",-1],[184,186,"in",-1],[187,190,"the",-1],[191,197,"garage",-1],[198,202,"with",-1],[203,206,"her",-1],[207,213,"little",2],[214,221,"brother",2],[223,226,"Leo",-1],[228,231,"who",-1],[232,235,"was",-1],[236,242,"always",-1],[243,249,"asking",-1],[250,259,"questions",-1]]},{"t":"\"Why does it erupt?\" Leo asked. \"When you mix baking soda and vinegar, they make a gas called carbon dioxide,\" Sofia explained. \"The gas pushes the liquid up and out, just like lava.\"","w":[[1,4,"why",-1],[5,9,"does",-1],[10,12,"it",-1],[13,18,"erupt",-1],[21,24,"Leo",-1],[25,30,"asked",-1],[33,37,"when",-1],[38,41,"you",-1],[42,45,"mix",-1],[46,52,"baking",3],[53,57,"soda",3],[58,61,"and",-1],[62,69,"vinegar",-1],[71,75,"they",-1],[76,80,"make",-1],[81,82,"a",-1],[83,86,"gas",-1],[87,93,"called",-1],[94,100,"carbon",4],[101,108,"dioxide",4],[111,116,"Sofia",-1],[117,126,"explained",-1],[129,132,"the",-1],[133,136,"gas",-1],[137,143,"pushes",-1],[144,147,"the",-1],[148,154,"liquid",-1],[155,157,"up",5],[158,161,"and",5],[162,165,"out",5],[167,171,"just",20],[172,176,"like",20],[177,181,"lava",-1]]},{"t":"She built the mountain from newspaper, glue and paint. It looked great. On the night before the fair, she tested it one last time. Nothing happened. She added more vinegar. Still there were only a few tired bubbles. Sofia wanted to cry.","w":[[0,3,"she",-1],[4,9,"built",-1],[10,13,"the",-1],[14,22,"mountain",-1],[23,27,"from",-1],[28,37,"newspaper",-1],[39,43,"glue",-1],[44,47,"and",-1],[48,53,"paint",-1],[55,57,"it",-1],[58,64,"looked",-1],[65,70,"great",-1],[72,74,"on",-1],[75,78,"the",-1],[79,84,"night",-1],[85,91,"before",-1],[92,95,"the",-1],[96,100,"fair",-1],[102,105,"she",-1],[106,112,"tested",-1],[113,115,"it",-1],[116,119,"one",6],[120,124,"last",6],[125,129,"time",6],[131,138,"nothing",-1],[139,147,"happened",-1],[149,152,"she",-1],[153,158,"added",-1],[159,163,"more",-1],[164,171,"vinegar",-1],[173,178,"still",-1],[179,184,"there",-1],[185,189,"were",-1],[190,194,"only",-1],[195,196,"a",-1],[197,200,"few",-1],[201,206,"tired",-1],[207,214,"bubbles",-1],[216,221,"Sofia",-1],[222,228,"wanted",-1],[229,231,"to",-1],[232,235,"cry",-1]]},{"t":"Leo picked up the box. \"Sofia, this box says 'baking powder,'\" he said. Sofia stared at it. Mom had bought the wrong box! It was too late to go to the store.","w":[[0,3,"Leo",-1],[4,10,"picked",7],[11,13,"up",7],[14,17,"the",-1],[18,21,"box",-1],[24,29,"Sofia",-1],[31,35,"this",-1],[36,39,"box",-1],[40,44,"says",-1],[46,52,"baking",8],[53,59,"powder",8],[63,65,"he",-1],[66,70,"said",-1],[72,77,"Sofia",-1],[78,84,"stared",9],[85,87,"at",9],[88,90,"it",-1],[92,95,"mom",-1],[96,99,"had",-1],[100,106,"bought",-1],[107,110,"the",-1],[111,116,"wrong",-1],[117,120,"box",-1],[122,124,"it",-1],[125,128,"was",-1],[129,132,"too",10],[133,137,"late",10],[138,140,"to",-1],[141,143,"go",-1],[1